”，可能更多是想象出来的重量。如果真有一天你累了、没撑住，你希望他们看到的是一个怎样的你？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1892,"promptTokens":2669,"completionTokens":109,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:03:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":39,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0066903238807449845,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67e14f4429d1fd72f7fb0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794539028443,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:03:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67e14f4429d1fd72f7fb0","chatId":"cd8f9180ae6f4751935357dd6a7b48a1","sessionId":null,"userId":99885,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（慢慢地说）怕他们失望吧。怕他们觉得，这个家靠不住我了。（顿了顿）其实……我也不知道，真发生了会怎样，好像也没那么可怕。<第19轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":38,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0066903238807449845,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67e14f4429d1fd72f7fb1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794539028440,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:03:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId